  "notes": "Knowlton Street jogs at Hamilton: west arm at y 1945, east arm at y 2065, recorded as two T's. Ingot Street continues south of Lingo as a diagonal printed only 'ALLEY' to Knowlton; a second unnamed diagonal alley runs Knowlton to Moline Court. '?' at Gulow (y 3966) is the diagonal street strip beside the Vandalia railroad (south side, 12in sewer, addresses 1623-1610); no name found; it merges into Blue Rock / Hamilton near the Blue Rock crossing. '?' at Ludlow is the diagonal AVENUE running north-east from the Hoffner/Ludlow junction (addresses 4003-4059, printed '...AVENUE' only in this area); its junction with Hoffner/Ludlow is approximate (about 30 px). Hamilton, Hoffner, Ludlow and Spring Grove meet in one open junction around (2230, 5370)."
